{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27295","headline":"玉巵无当 · 蒋防","name":"玉巵无当","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美玉常爲器，兹焉变漏巵。\n酒浆悲莫挹，樽俎念空施。\n符彩功难补，盈虚数已亏。\n岂惟孤玩好，抑亦类瑕疵。\n清越音虽在，操持意渐隳。\n赋形期大匠，良璞勿同斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}